/target

# Patch/merge leftovers
*.orig
*.rej

# Atomic-write temp files stranded by an interrupted taskpad run. They are
# created beside their target, so one can end up in a taskpad-managed
# directory such as specs/tasks/ — and it is inert: not a `T*.md` file, not
# `status.yaml`, not `.taskpad`.
.taskpad-tmp-*
